<body>
<h1>Pricing Experiment Plan — REPLACE-EXPERIMENT-ID</h1>
<table><thead><tr><th>Field</th><th>Value</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>experiment_id</td><td>REPLACE-slug-with-date</td></tr><tr><td>start_date</td><td>YYYY-MM-DD</td></tr><tr><td>end_date</td><td>YYYY-MM-DD</td></tr><tr><td>duration_days</td><td>7-90</td></tr><tr><td>variant_old.stripe_price_id</td><td>price_REPLACE</td></tr><tr><td>variant_new.stripe_price_id</td><td>price_REPLACE</td></tr><tr><td>audience</td><td>new_signups_only \</td><td>new_and_existing_with_grandfather \</td><td>specific_segment</td></tr><tr><td>exposure_rule</td><td>one paragraph explaining how visitors map to variants</td></tr><tr><td>success_metric_primary</td><td>e.g. trial_to_paid_conversion_pct</td></tr><tr><td>success_metric_threshold</td><td>numeric</td></tr><tr><td>significance_target</td><td>p&lt;0.05 \</td><td>p&lt;0.10 \</td><td>bayesian_95</td></tr><tr><td>guardrail_metrics</td><td>refund_rate, dispute_rate, support_ticket_rate</td></tr><tr><td>currencies_in_test</td><td>usd \</td><td>eur \</td><td>...</td></tr><tr><td>tax_behavior</td><td>inclusive \</td><td>exclusive</td></tr></tbody></table>
<h2>Grandfathering</h2>
<ul><li>audience: REPLACE</li><li>mechanism: 100% off coupon on new Price OR separate old Price object</li><li>stripe_coupon_id: REPLACE</li><li>window_months: REPLACE</li><li>renewal_after_window: REPLACE</li></ul>
<h2>Termination rules</h2>
<ul><li>refund_rate &gt; 2x baseline OR support_ticket_rate &gt; 3x baseline → terminate, revert</li><li>dispute_rate &gt; 0.5% → terminate, revert</li><li>significance not reached at 80% of plan → extend by 30 days max, then force go/no-go</li><li>significance reached with negative MRR effect → terminate, revert, document</li></ul>
</body></html>
